ick rows such that each element is covered exactly once and no overlap.\n\nWe can approach by enumerating possibilities.\n\nLet's consider cases based on which row covers element 0.\n\nCase A: choose row 1 for element 0 (and 1). Row1 covers {0,1}. Then elements 0 and 1 are covered. Remaining elements to cover: 2,3,4. We cannot choose any row that contains 0 or 1 again. So we cannot choose rows 3,9 (contain 0) or row10 (contains 1). So remaining rows allowed: 0,2,4,5,6,7,8. But we must cover 2,3,4 exactly once each.\n\nNow we need to cover 2,3,4 with disjoint rows from allowed set.\n\nLet's list allowed rows with their sets:\n\n0: {2}\n2: {3,4}\n4: {2,3}\n5: {4}\n6: {2}\n7: {4}\n8: {3}\n\nWe need to cover 2"}}],"created":1790945779,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4185,"total_tokens":4953,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-v5ETBW9bFaFu5ZRpcEiK9x62bz2TdTfp","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4185,"prompt_ms":516.679,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12345973715651135,"prompt_per_second":8099.806649776748,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2428.721,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.1665202086049544,"predicted_per_second":315.8040795958037}}